   \textbackslash{}usepackage\{upgreek\}
   \textbackslash{}setlength\{\textbackslash{}oddsidemargin\}\{-69pt\}
   \textbackslash{}begin\{document\}\$\$N =
   338\$\$\textbackslash{}end\{document\}) show that (1) intra-list and
   selection diversity are significantly improved with negligible impact on
   accuracy and (2) that the use of diversity-optimized recommender systems
   can lead to an increase in user satisfaction.},
DOI = {10.1007/s11257-024-09399-w},
